// Ibis Crossover body: a mid-2000s car-based crossover.
//
// Intent: tall and upright on a sedan's bones, not a truck. A rounded nose with swept lamps and
// a wide bright grille, a raked windshield, a long flat roof with rails, a steep rear hatch,
// a high beltline, gray lower cladding round the arches, wrapped tail lamps and big
// five-spoke alloys. Mostly silver and dark metallics. Generic period cues only.
//
// Units are meters; x runs rearward from the nose, y up from the ground. Layout:
// docs/VEHICLES.md and crates/vehicle/src/shape/params.rs.
